flowchart TD
    P([Player]) -->|natural-language message| UI[Streamlit UI<br/>version-1/app.py]
    UI -->|message| GM[Game Master<br/>game_master.py]
    SP[System prompt with story,<br/>rules AND answers<br/>prompts.py] -.-> G1
    GM -->|1. try| G1[Gemini 3.8 Flash]
    G1 -->|error / quota 429| G2[Gemini 3.7 Flash<br/>history transferred]
    G2 -->|error / quota 429| OFF[Offline rule engine<br/>Python dictionaries]
    G1 -->|story text +<br/>GAME_STATE line| PARSE
    G2 -->|story text +<br/>GAME_STATE line| PARSE
    OFF -->|story text +<br/>GAME_STATE line| PARSE[Status parser<br/>regex on GAME_STATE]
    PARSE -->|trials, curse, inventory,<br/>escaped, game_over| SS[(st.session_state)]
    SS --> UI
    UI -->|chat + sidebar| P
    classDef ai fill:#fde2c8,stroke:#c2410c;
    classDef py fill:#dbeafe,stroke:#1d4ed8;
